      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "opencode serve --port 4096\n\nBuilt-in tools: bash, read/write/edit, glob/grep, subagent, web_fetch, web_search\n\nOur custom tools (plugins): browser (Browserbase), email (Gmail), calendar (GCal), message (Telegram/Slack), web_fetch, computer (spawn sandbox), memory (volume/Convex)\n\nSessions, compaction, permissions = OpenCode native",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "opencode serve --port 4096\n\nBuilt-in tools: bash, read/write/edit, glob/grep, subagent, web_fetch, web_search\n\nOur custom tools (plugins): browser (Browserbase), email (Gmail), calendar (GCal), message (Telegram/Slack), web_fetch, computer (spawn sandbox), memory (volume/Convex)\n\nSessions, compaction, permissions = OpenCode native",
